 The lines intersect when their parametric equations are equal. We set the vectors $\vec{v}$ and $\vec{w}$ equal to each other and solve the resulting system of equations for $t$ and $u$. The system is:
\begin{align*}
7 - 2t &= 8 + u \\
-3 + 5t &= -1 - 4u \\
1 + t &= -1 \\
\end{align*}
Solving the third equation for $t$, we get $t = -2$. Substituting this into the first two equations gives:
\begin{align*}
